<title>FINLAND: FINNISH BOND YIELDS FALL ON U.S. Q4 ECI REPORT.</title>
<headline>FINNISH BOND YIELDS FALL ON U.S. Q4 ECI REPORT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish bond yields fell following below-forecast 0.8 percent U.S. Q4 employment cost index rise. </p>
<p>* 2006 bond yield falls four basis points to 6.08 percent.</p>
<p>* Economists on average had forecast 0.9 percent ECI rise.</p>
</text>
